     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "This self-assessment checklist is designed to enhance one’s awareness and sensitivity of cultural and linguistic diversity and to provide concrete examples of practices that foster an environment of cultural and linguistic competence, allowing the nurse to reflect and engage in self-improvement."
